Hi Kerim,

This is a bug in the CRAN version of Wallace. Hopefully, this issue was reported and fixed in the development version of Wallace in GitHub (link with the issue <https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace/issues/145>). Please, install Wallace from Github using the following code:

install.packages("devtools")
devtools::install_github("wallaceEcoMod/wallace")
library(wallace)
run_wallace()

Also, the problem will be fixed in the next release on CRAN.

Let me know if this fixes your problem.

Best,
Gonzalo

