We are working on this issue. We need to make some changes in Wallace to work with the new version of the ENMeval package (more info <https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace/issues/157>). A temporary solution is installing the oldest version of ENMeval.

> devtools::install_github("bobmuscarella/ENM...@Version-0.2.2")

Please, let me know if this temporary solution works for you.

Best,
Gonzalo

